	"system": {
		"description": "<p>At 18th level, the sheer power you wield with magic channeled through steel is renowned and feared. Once per short rest, you may attempt to shatter the line. When you @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.5j1UqnHUHm5MGDQx]{Spellstrike} or cast a cantrip which requires a melee weapon attack, you can attempt to drive your opponents back with each powerful swing. Any character damaged by your spellstrike or your cantrip must make an Intelligence saving throw or be thrown back 10ft away from you.</p>",
